sequenceDiagram
    title One completed set to the next recommendation
    participant User
    participant ChatGPTAgent
    participant McpBackend
    participant PrismaPostgres

    User->>ChatGPTAgent: Completed set and feedback
    ChatGPTAgent->>McpBackend: Record set with request key
    McpBackend->>PrismaPostgres: Commit set and retry record
    PrismaPostgres-->>McpBackend: Saved facts and version
    McpBackend-->>ChatGPTAgent: Saved set and session context
    ChatGPTAgent->>McpBackend: Save assessed target revision
    McpBackend->>PrismaPostgres: Commit target revision
    PrismaPostgres-->>McpBackend: Saved revision identifier
    McpBackend-->>ChatGPTAgent: Saved next target
    ChatGPTAgent-->>User: Next set or exercise

